The USCG is procuring Refuse and Recycling Collection and Disposal services at Base Cape Cod, MA and USCG owned housing in Harwich, MA. 

The contractor shall provide all labor, supervision, transportation, equipment, contractor-furnished containers and totes, disposal, recycling, permits, and incidental services necessary to collect, transport, recycle, and dispose of refuse generated at USCG Base Cape Cod, Massachusetts, and USCG-owned housing in Harwich, Massachusetts. 



Please review RFQ 70ZL9527QDL950002 and all attachments for more details.&nbsp;
